# Installing [[ project_name ]]
[%- if has_homebrew_cask %]

## Homebrew (macOS/Linux)

```sh
brew install hugoh/tap/[[ project_name ]]
```
[%- endif %]
[%- if package_format == "nfpm" %]

## Debian/Ubuntu (apt)

```sh
curl -1sLf 'https://dl.cloudsmith.io/public/hugoh/apt/setup.deb.sh' | sudo -E bash
sudo apt install [[ project_name ]]
```

## RHEL/Fedora (dnf)

```sh
curl -1sLf 'https://dl.cloudsmith.io/public/hugoh/rpm/setup.rpm.sh' | sudo -E bash
sudo dnf install [[ project_name ]]
```

Package repository hosting is graciously provided by
[Cloudsmith](https://cloudsmith.com).

## Package files

Download the `.deb` or `.rpm` from the
[releases page](https://github.com/hugoh/[[ project_name ]]/releases) and install it
with your package manager:

```sh
# Debian/Ubuntu
sudo apt install ./[[ project_name ]]_*.deb

# RHEL/Fedora
sudo dnf install ./[[ project_name ]]_*.rpm
```
[%- else %]

## Binary

Download the binary for your platform from the
[releases page](https://github.com/hugoh/[[ project_name ]]/releases).
[%- endif %]

## mise

```sh
mise use -g github:hugoh/[[ project_name ]]
```
